  dialogue:
  - id: dialogue:eec70a38ba9e5e0539d420b21b86871ccda9083d63212e7df37796d6a4822480
    transcript: Hi there. I was hoping you were brave enough to meet me.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c4e3e69af43cd5d49ac7f68762175538, type: 3}
    engineeringPlaceholder: 1
  - id: dialogue:fa46c48a4c46fd184ce1a59a52ff0b8eced1f6f74e8068a34c5c581aa5fc4c67
    transcript: I'm Lara. I'm a digital hallucination.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a1259b38bb70fb9458369bcd75f8c7d0, type: 3}
    engineeringPlaceholder: 1
  - id: dialogue:8903bad7f2e7f454c60ec70764a890d8820e0b56b453e653f9105c2f2fd90507
    transcript: Well, more than a hallucination. A bit of a... projection. An intrusion?
      (giggles) I like that one. Intrusion.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7196192d01214fa42aba1a98cdd7c560, type: 3}
    engineeringPlaceholder: 1
  - id: dialogue:f8b55ddbaa527c7f4a06e5eccbcdbbbc8ae76bce5bb690d1ed0c00c33de86d84
    transcript: I'm the most fun you've ever had. But I come with... conditions.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2c863949c2b186841b363ef3e6a3f2ab, type: 3}
    engineeringPlaceholder: 1
  - id: dialogue:3532947e8c4c89b969bb7098d0e4ea314affc33b584eb529c99c867c020104aa
    transcript: I can only give you pleasure if I have the power to do so. The more
      you give up to me, the more I can do for you. Let's see what you're giving
      up, tonight.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8795f4839ad46b240a494625e92175b5, type: 3}
    engineeringPlaceholder: 1
  - id: dialogue:a31e67d1d242a517ea991955985c0bffc320ffb723e9993125ce4e222e8ed172
    transcript: Not bad for a start.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9bf9df0dff0b3194dbd9898882835585, type: 3}
    engineeringPlaceholder: 1
  - id: dialogue:9a0767c9e5e6d57eaa147f30fb0fbb7c9b9e3d7ea696a8102b1ccb7ab47f4384
    transcript: This is your submission score. The more activities you consent to,
      the higher it goes, but... I don't want you bending past your real limits.
      Honesty is important. But...(giggles) so's letting me try new things. So next
      time we start a scene... look for things you're willing to try for me and let
      me know if you come up with any.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e9c599ceee7c50a4088e5eea295ca106, type: 3}
    engineeringPlaceholder: 1
  - id: dialogue:ed13cc210d45dc15e01dc276ebe226fb63cf25e4c54c4a830fb159a8ef325df1
    transcript: Now let's look at your equipment...(giggles) Not that equipment,
      yet.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f7863a0d700e13946a6ff10a2dead932, type: 3}
    engineeringPlaceholder: 1
  - id: dialogue:6b35307084bcc03453d78eca45994aa9b2ebd884af15e869a8f8965aef12ed48
    transcript: And finally, tell me what you're wearing....
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: de98806d2a627fc4f9b2e1d9e276643a, type: 3}
    engineeringPlaceholder: 1
  - id: dialogue:a2da4644f43872c42ababc3faafb00bc5f59c460d8ad619a4d4fe72dd3287af9
    transcript: Now that's a go-getter. The less you wear to our sessions, the better.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4b545e6edc923d84495192909906b735, type: 3}
    engineeringPlaceholder: 1
  - id: dialogue:2d353b980d4faaba8f3a6e8544277684b00611133f8e258ed6b3005cc3a11b1a
    transcript: I like you naked, but I can wait to get you there...
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 208da2b5af1558243b781fbc04e3f288, type: 3}
    engineeringPlaceholder: 1
  - id: dialogue:1eff8d34806c7afa1ed18afe7d74c157bdb8ffc9d03c9583497229bc98ec5cd0
    transcript: That's way too dressed. The fewer you wear the happier I am. In fact...
      take one off now.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 447a94e42eb4c6a40b30dd88c06a37c1, type: 3}
    engineeringPlaceholder: 1
  - id: dialogue:5808e8bf8f569555b089c738f69a1ed115838a755273105006ad007b78614719
    transcript: Alright, let's get you warmed up.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 512d4fc1778e31341ad81c54aa707655, type: 3}
    engineeringPlaceholder: 1
  - id: dialogue:1b4f4776f18b9dc697d55dc3b03525fc48594bc079dd1b085f98d8289bbb00a2
    transcript: I think it's time to lose the rest of the clothes... do that and
      tell me when you're back.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f434fda7d59df4f4fbf2893540bb65cb, type: 3}
    engineeringPlaceholder: 1
  - id: dialogue:4813b6225ba5c47d9e29c552beeb572872df08a9958c17ad621093d71684ce72
    transcript: That was all the warmup I'm going to give you. Now let's get down
      to business.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cac1bab331f48c247bcba2b89d17c616, type: 3}
    engineeringPlaceholder: 1
  - id: dialogue:1dd1d72ffbadaa33a2ce75dfab76ce9004e379e5b48bac085c75cbda0687fa6d
    transcript: I'm amused enough, I suppose. And since this is your first time,
      I'm not going to frustrate you... or even make you beg. I'm just going to make
      you cum.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8e941bde03aca5a459bc51513860e426, type: 3}
    engineeringPlaceholder: 1
  - id: dialogue:e743274fcdd56ce6aa95572b33e917f49fc42ad33a11b3d1e01866b557e2617b
    transcript: '*giggles* Well, you seem to understand the assignment. Some times
      you''re going to have to work for it. Some times you may have to work and not
      even get it then. It all depends on my mood, and how much you decide to trust
      me.'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2be04ec5e7df5a34eb7a8ee508969613, type: 3}
    engineeringPlaceholder: 1
  - id: dialogue:7b5488f0b0337a9170591f660acad8fd145ee410eeeecfeeb12d9788627463d9
    transcript: Now, how am I going to keep you thinking about me until our next
      session?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 671caa699db01b547868f6e2b22fd185, type: 3}
    engineeringPlaceholder: 1
  - id: dialogue:fd2d57a95269c819d7a391e54f7d9c333d8c7447e2d913f1440a87e5f99b9abf
    transcript: Alright, that's our session for tonight. Until next time... behave.
      Or don't. I get off either way. *giggles* Bye!
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7b077161d9ee0ef4f9fd3097c2f8485b, type: 3}
    engineeringPlaceholder: 1
